        "text": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Vivid Direct is your specialist supplier of professional lighting and accessories, trusted by electricians, contractors, and homeowners alike. From everyday essentials to cutting-edge smart lighting, we combine a huge range of quality products with friendly expert support and fast delivery. Whether you're tackling a single room or upgrading a whole home or business, we're here to help you get the right lighting solution, first time.</p>",
